  "steps": [
    "Tear the tofu into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Toss with cornflour, Kashmiri chilli powder, Italian seasoning, soy sauce, salt, pepper and 1 tsp oil.",
    "Air fry at 200°C for 12–15 minutes, shaking halfway, until golden and crispy.",
    "For the sauce, heat 1 tsp oil and sauté onion and garlic.",
    "Add chopped tomatoes, ketchup, spices, salt and pepper. Cook until jammy.",
    "Turn off the heat completely, add Greek yogurt and mix until creamy.",
    "Add the crispy tofu and coat it in the sauce.",
    "Top with mozzarella, cover and let it melt.",
    "Finish with chilli flakes and fresh coriander/parsley."
  ],
